{"summary":"Design a towering mega mall in this mall management simulation game.","description":"Design a towering mall of mega proportions! Attract droves of customers and elevate yourself to 5-star status in this mall management simulation game! \n\nAdd anything from fast food joints to sushi restaurants, stairs and elevators--even a heliport--all with a touch of the finger! \n\nWhen your establishment's popularity reaches a certain point, a \"Fever\" is triggered in which customers swamp your mall! \n\nYou can then exercise your newfound affluence by investing in the surrounding area--bringing in even more customers and being a good citizen at the same time! Oh yeah! \n\nKeep your eyes on the mega-prize--only you can build the ultimate mall! \n\n--\nTry searching for \"Kairosoft\" to see all of our games, or visit us at https://kairopark.jp. Be sure to check out both our free-to-play and our paid games!","esrbNotes":null,"pegiNotes":null,"iapPrices":null,"video":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/yTRV2erczjg?vq=large&rel=0&autohide=1&showinfo=0","header":"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/q-mcYPYP1UYS0Iy2RrYgk_r5JtivzLDnOWqDv3mK_jyCpImzw330QxbwA_DnVXri3y7q34r_nDzFzyDDmYz6PQ","screenshots":["https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/uWxuS7VeQplBpXJv6lSbxKbHl9C2dGME_7AYP3RXtaPJLmHIe1VK9kaNhse2GsozdELn4cuAw6F86LffN1gBIdg","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/RU5H5LEGdNkF4FNTmENL1ZUJWthxMCldFCErM5zIduz-PndhWSUyyM9elqWJFZCxJjHA7qt9vE_4wsV7F-iE","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/HRS3P6A73VdGoIbzQaLV0LkQ6gDcA2E6nTxgibN4srnUAKlq4q5xhm26wjID9s7U31gWg4ItFez7clnL1blX","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/P8MP-nx_PfyIgXaoSYfeuxPVBafp2l8RLh0OZCmJFkUltXHjjJLqaL3Kg0xFDS5HvZMBSFFg3mDHX4Jj1RjALxM","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/RsFlz3nlLTQH1zI7lRLJwQUwRMvw1cYoBjE7RtsQ6gE4e2aUYga9_MZB6ReSlynD57a8IUhZk0uH396lW47mzQ","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/qrIpI0kUrzmXOnT8UN8iTOCrwHfWWrbW5WFu3sMku61L4J98bFxngQCPWesHkTI0u_eX_UVo_g2rNLOQCBYPfA","https://play-lh.googleuserc